# paradigmxyz/reth#27615 "fix(trie): complete range changesets" (open; the
# pinned reth is the buggy build). A historical overlay's aggregate range
# reverts miss a trie node created, persisted, then deleted while the
# state-trie frontier lags the persisted tip, so the stale node shows up in
# historical proofs and roots.
RETH_FIX_PR=27615
RETH_FIX_HEAD=30904dc4158defd496565da8f28671af81096091
# Default node flags already trigger it: the generated load's first smoke
# campaign on the pinned node (seed 1) failed E5/E6 untargeted-* and
# multiproof-* at historical depths 45-249 while targeted eth_getProof agreed
# with the header.
VARIANT=default
CAMPAIGN_ARGS="--workload-arg load=trie"
EXPECT=E5/
